OL,3,GNEWSAScottish independence referendum
OL,4,A'a million miles away' - Offord
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Reform UK in Scotland has
OL,7,Fsaid support for independence is "a
OL,8,Fmillion miles away" from the level
OL,9,Frequired to justify a second
OL,10,Freferendum.
OL,12,FThe Scottish government last week
OL,13,Fpublished its draft independence
OL,14,Freferendum bill, setting out the
OL,15,Fdetails of the proposed question and
OL,16,Fwho would be allowed to vote.
OL,18,FBut Malcolm Offord told BBC Radio
OL,19,FScotland's Mornings programme that
OL,20,Fthere would need to be a "groundswell"
OL,21,Fof support for a fresh poll.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
